---
// The heavy Noto Serif SC/JP @font-face CSS (~168KB gz of unicode-range
// subsets), combined into a single stylesheet asset in src/styles/cjk-fonts.css.
//
// It's imported with `?url` — i.e. as an asset URL *string*, NOT as a
// side-effect style import — on purpose. A side-effect `import '…css'` is
// collected by Astro's per-page CSS crawl and would ship on every page that
// shares this component's module graph (e.g. every blog post), even ones that
// never render it. `?url` is just a hashed asset reference, so the stylesheet
// ships only where the <link> below is actually rendered: pages whose content
// contains CJK. English pages render nothing here and ship zero of it.
//
// Vite still processes the CSS (rewrites the font url()s to hashed /_astro
// assets and emits the woff2s), so the fonts resolve correctly.
import cjkFontsHref from '../styles/cjk-fonts.css?url';
---

<link rel="stylesheet" href={cjkFontsHref} />
